        <TR><TD WIDTH="480" BALIGN="LEFT" ALIGN="LEFT"><B>IntegrationData</B><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>t [T]; physical states [m, T]; diagnostics.<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>Returned by the numerical method to simulate.</TD></TR>
